        "id": "fe-over-p1",
        "type": "text-block",
        "settings": {
         "content": "<p>We start in the fishing village of Reine and work our way north — hiking the ridgelines by day, paddling the sheltered sounds, and sleeping in rorbu cabins and a wild camp or two.</p><p>It's a real traverse, not a basecamp loop. You'll feel the distance in your legs and earn every view. No technical climbing — just steady days on good trails with one of our Lofoten-born guides.</p>",
         "text_color": "var(--olo-color-text-muted)",
         "font_size": "16",
         "line_height": "1.7",
